Build against Proxmox's crates from their git repository: Debian builds this
with the Proxmox crates packaged as Debian source packages (librust-*-dev in a
local registry); they are not on crates.io. The [patch.crates-io] section
points every proxmox-* crate at git.proxmox.com's proxmox.git, at commit
9bf4383b6ad4225367c7824023ad74769388de8f (2026-11-11), the state Proxmox's
packages had when this release was made; files/Cargo.lock pins the result.
Unused entries are harmless (cargo lists them as unused patches).
Written for FenrirOS.

--- a/termproxy/Cargo.toml
+++ b/termproxy/Cargo.toml
@@ -22,3 +22,76 @@
